Once satisfied, untoggle switch.</note>
    <button x="215" y="420" height="40" disableUntilTicks="false" forever="false" kind="Observer" width="135" display="Show/Hide Footpaths">ask roads [
  if member? road-type ["footway" "path" "cycleway" "steps"] [
